@startuml a05-l2-web-edge
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Building Block View — Level 2: Whitebox "Web Edge"

package "Web Edge (whitebox) — routes/web.php + app/Http/" {
  [routes/web.php\nroute table, auth group,\nper-route throttles] as routes
  [Controllers/ (×4)\none per dialogue area;\nnotes controller = pipeline orchestrator] as ctrl
  [Requests/ (×1)\ncapture validation] as req
  [Middleware/ (×2)\nsecurity headers (wired),\nAPI-key guard (unwired)] as mw
}

' Level-1 neighbours of this whitebox (blackboxes here)
rectangle "UI Shell (L1)" as ui #EEEEEE
rectangle "Domain Services (L1)" as domain #EEEEEE
rectangle "Integration Adapters (L1)" as adapters #EEEEEE
rectangle "Persistence (L1)" as persistence #EEEEEE
file "config/herold.php" as cfg

ui --> routes : HTTPS — Inertia visits, form posts,\nmultipart upload, audio streaming
routes --> ctrl : one route group\nper controller
mw .. routes : appended to the\nweb group
ctrl ..> req : validates capture via
req ..> cfg : type keys +\nextra-field rules
ctrl --> domain : preprocessing, sanitisation,\ntype catalogue
ctrl --> adapters : transcription seam (Process),\nticket seam (Send)
ctrl --> persistence : note CRUD, status, audio path;\nuser record, dashboard aggregates
ctrl ..> cfg : github target\n(settings view)

note bottom of mw
  One of the two middleware classes is wired
  nowhere (dead code, A11 D-06); the session
  ""auth"" guard is the single gate.
end note

@enduml
